<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(aa) &ldquo;<B>Event
of Default Redemption Premium</B>&rdquo; means 125%.</P>

