means FactSet Research Systems Inc.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.5in">(dd) &ldquo;<B>Fiscal
Quarter</B>&rdquo; means each of the fiscal quarters adopted by the Company for financial reporting purposes that correspond to the Company&rsquo;s
fiscal year as of the date hereof that ends on December 31<SUP>st</SUP>.</P>

